"""As-filed cover statuses for CO-REGISTRANTS on combined (multi-CIK) annual
reports. A combined 10-K (utility holding companies, airlines, REIT + operating
partnership) lists each registrant's own filer-category / WKSI / shell / SRC /
EGC checkboxes and registration on the cover, but tags them all under the parent
CIK in XBRL — so the per-registrant values can only come from the cover text.

Read by independent agents over each combined cover (Haiku read, Sonnet review,
Opus adjudicating disagreements), then committed here so a from-scratch rebuild
reproduces them. Keyed "accession|CIK" (co-registrants only; the primary filer
keeps the filing's own cover_facts). afs LAF/AF/NAF; src/egc/wksi/shell "0"/"1";
reg 12b/12g/15d. A blank means the registrant's cover showed no such box, so the
per-CIK default applies (NAF / not-X / 15(d)).
"""

